WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Almost midnight, and parents are still asking.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.920
The same questions, every evening.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:12.040
Now the answers are in one place.
Parents register themselves.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:21.000
They sign the contract and pay.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.010
Four minutes. And you were already asleep.

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:31.660
And it's like that all season.
No more reminders about money.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:35.080
Attendance: one tap.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:42.480
Contracts: no paper. You see everything.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:52.300
Less admin. More time for teaching.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.660
ExoClass. Start the season without chaos.
